# Homebrew trust declarations.
# Format: type name
# Supported types: formula, cask, tap
#
# Examples:
#   cask xykong/tap/flux-markdown
#   formula jeremy4971/mysides-swift/mysides-swift
#
# Do NOT wrap strings in quotes! They would confuse the text parser.

cask xykong/tap/flux-markdown
formula jeremy4971/mysides-swift/mysides-swift
